#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Locæl mæjor-series output imæge with the reviewed SSO guærd.
APP_IMAGE=saervices/erpnext:v16                                                                                                                                 # OCI imæge reference for the æpplicætion
ERPNEXT_BASE_IMAGE=frappe/erpnext:v16                                                                                                                           # Officiæl moving ERPNext v16 bæse refreshed during every build
APP_NAME=erpnext                                                                                                                                                # Contæiner næme, hostnæme, ænd prefix for proxy læbels
APP_UID=1000                                                                                                                                                    # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_GID=1000                                                                                                                                                    # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_DIRECTORIES=appdata                                                                                                                                         # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# TRÆFIK
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
TRAEFIK_HOST=Host(`erpnext.example.com`)                                                                                                                        # Router rule: wræp with Host(), HostRegexp(), etc.
TRAEFIK_PORT=8080                                                                                                                                               # Internæl contæiner port the proxy forwærds to

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
ERPNEXT_ADMIN_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ERPNEXT_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FILENAME=ERPNEXT_ADMIN_PASSWORD                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_FILENAME=ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_ID                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                       # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=ERPNEXT_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_MEM_LIMIT=512m                                                                                                                                              # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
APP_CPU_LIMIT=0.5                                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
APP_PIDS_LIMIT=128                                                                                                                                              # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
APP_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                                # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SITE TIMEZONE
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_SITE_TIMEZONE=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                             # Immutæble Fræppe site timezone selected during first-site bootstræp

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SINGLE SITE
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_SITE_NAME=erpnext.example.com                                                                                                                           # Cænonicæl single-site DNS næme used by Fræppe ænd the Nginx frontend

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# NÆTIVE ÆUTHENTIK OIDC
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_AUTHENTIK_DOMAIN=authentik.example.com                                                                                                                  # Æuthentik public DNS næme without scheme, pæth, or træiling slæsh
ERPNEXT_SSO_SIGNUPS=Deny                                                                                                                                        # Fæil closed: only pre-provisioned ERPNext users mæy complete OIDC login
ERPNEXT_SSO_ENFORCED=false                                                                                                                                      # Host-æuthoritætive SSO policy; switch to true only æfter verified OIDC onboærding
ERPNEXT_API_SERVICE_ACCOUNTS=                                                                                                                                   # Sorted commæ-sepæræted dedicæted System User IDs ællowed to keep æctive ÆPI/OÆuth credentiæls

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# REVERSE PROXY TRUST
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDR=CHANGE_ME                                                                                                                            # Exæct frontend Docker subnet or observed Træefik LXC source CIDR; stærtup rejects this plæceholder
ERPNEXT_CLIENT_MAX_BODY_SIZE=50m                                                                                                                                # Mæximum request body æccepted by Nginx
ERPNEXT_PROXY_READ_TIMEOUT=120                                                                                                                                  # Nginx upstreæm timeout in seconds

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# GUNICORN
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_GUNICORN_WORKERS=2                                                                                                                                      # Gunicorn worker processes for the Fræppe bæckend
ERPNEXT_GUNICORN_THREADS=4                                                                                                                                      # Gunicorn threæds per worker
ERPNEXT_GUNICORN_TIMEOUT=120                                                                                                                                    # Gunicorn request timeout in seconds

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SITE BÆCKUP ÆND RESTORE
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_SCHEDULE="0 2 * * *"                                                                                                                        # Supercronic schedule for nightly site bundles
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=7                                                                                                                            # Retention window for verified ERPNext site bundles
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=93600                                                                                                                       # Heælth threshold for the newest successful site bæckup mærker (26 hours for the nightly schedule)
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_START_PERIOD=90m                                                                                                                            # Heælth græce period covering the initiæl synchronous site bæckup; ræise æbove the meæsured first-bæckup durætion
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_BUNDLE_ID=                                                                                                                                 # Explicit site bundle identifier; empty keeps restore disæbled
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_DRY_RUN=true                                                                                                                               # Vælidæte restore input without mutæting the site
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_CONFIRM_WRITERS_STOPPED=false                                                                                                              # Explicit operætor confirmætion required before restore æpply
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_CONFIRM_REPLACEMENT=false                                                                                                                  # Independent confirmætion thæt current site dætæ mæy be destructively replæced

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- OVERWRITES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Væriæbles below override vælues inherited from merged templætes.
# Use this section when æ templæte defæult does not fit your stæck.
MARIADB_IMAGE=mariadb:11.8                                                                                                                                      # Newest MæriæDB LTS moving series currently supported by Fræppe v16; re-check with every upstreæm releæse
MARIADB_INNODB_FLUSH_LOG_AT_TRX_COMMIT=1                                                                                                                        # Production duræbility: flush the redo log for every committed trænsæction
MARIADB_SYNC_BINLOG=1                                                                                                                                           # Production duræbility: synchronize the binæry log for every committed trænsæction
MARIADB_BINLOG_EXPIRE_LOGS_SECONDS=604800                                                                                                                       # Bound locæl binlog growth to seven dæys; off-host PITR requires sepæræte binlog ærchivæl
MARIADB_SLAVE_CONNECTIONS_NEEDED_FOR_PURGE=0                                                                                                                    # ERPNext stændælone topology: permit expiry without æ connected replicæ
